@name     wave_to_phonemes
@alias    w>p
@group    wave
@c_name   skode_clause_wave_to_phonemes_0
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  transcribe active voice wave to phoneme DSL string
@doc
Analyzes active voice wavetable slot with LPC formant/pitch tracking and stores transcribed phoneme DSL string into context string.
Usage: w>p
@code
    return skode_exec_wave_to_phonemes(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end

